<title>SENEGAL: SOCCER-SENEGAL AND EGYPT DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SENEGAL AND EGYPT DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senegal and Egypt drew 0-0 in the</p>
<p>first leg of their African Nations Cup group 3 qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance 50.000.</p>
</text>
